sequenceDiagram
 participant Provider as Provider transport
 participant Turn as Session turn assembler
 participant Store as SQLite write owner
 participant Broker as Tool broker
 participant Tools as Tool targets

 Provider-->>Turn: Complete native calls A, B and C
 Turn->>Store: Persist call IDs, ordinals, arguments and native blocks
 Store-->>Turn: Envelopes durable
 Turn->>Broker: Request admission under current controls
 Note over Broker,Tools: Only independent permitted calls run concurrently

 par A - permitted read succeeds
  Broker->>Tools: Dispatch A after durable admission
  Tools-->>Broker: Result A
  Broker->>Store: Persist completed result A
 and B - approval required
  Broker->>Store: Record waiting operation B and approval proposal
  Note over Broker,Tools: B is not dispatched
  Broker->>Store: Persist ApprovalRequired response B
 and C - independent read fails
  Broker->>Tools: Dispatch C after durable admission
  Tools-->>Broker: Known read failure C
  Broker->>Store: Persist failure response C
 end

 Note over Turn,Store: Completion order may differ from recorded call order
 Turn->>Store: Read durable responses in A, B, C order
 Store-->>Turn: Completed A, ApprovalRequired B, Failed C
 Turn->>Store: Persist provider continuation material
 Turn->>Provider: Adapter-native ordered tool results
 Note over Provider,Broker: Independent work may continue while B waits

 opt Later human decision on operation B
  Broker->>Store: Record new decision and attributed event
  Note over Store,Tools: Revalidate parent controls, ownership, plan and approval
  Note over Turn,Store: Append later outcome without rewriting old response B
 end
